  "description": "Aboard General Grievous' ship, Jedi Knights Obi-Wan and Anakin finally locate the captive Chancellor Palpatine. But before they can escape, they come face-to-face with a determined Count Dooku, who is more powerful than ever. Kenobi is rendered unconscious during their ensuing Lightsaber battle, but Anakin manages to turn the tables by briefly giving in to the dark side...at the sinister urging of Palpatine. Dooku's hands are severed, rendering him incapable of defending himself, yet Anakin finishes his enemy off without mercy. Soon after, Kenobi regains consciousness, and a final battle for control of General Grievous' ship takes place on the bridge..."
